   "source": {
    "label": "Result:Corollary:1",
    "number": "Corollary 1",
    "quote": "When the gaps of all the sub-optimal arms are identical, i.e., $\\Delta_i =\\Delta = \\sqrt{\\frac{K\\log K}{T}}>\\sqrt{\\frac{e}{T}}, \\forall i\\in \\A$ and $C_3$ being an integer constant, the regret of EUCBV is upper bounded by the following gap-independent expression: \\E[R_{T}]\\leq \\dfrac{C_3 K^5}{T^{\\frac{1}{4}}} + 80\\sqrt{KT}."
   },
   "confidence": "low",
